e, $\\text{curl}\\,F$ also points away from the screen, in the direction of increasing $z.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and IV only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186241117 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f7d78c56-0653-549d-8fe9-e600bbc18e04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437510} {:answer/id #uuid "7fda3753-247c-5e38-a385-69d3789ea1ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437511}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f7d78c56-0653-549d-8fe9-e600bbc18e04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437510} :answer-field/id #uuid "d46aee06-be1c-589d-8527-7c703976fa69" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438784} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fc92ea1-396a-5412-b8bd-1b4004d4228c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437512} {:answer/id #uuid "0568e3f2-60bd-5c83-9d49-f6bb4d6708c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437513}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0568e3f2-60bd-5c83-9d49-f6bb4d6708c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437513} :answer-field/id #uuid "13972053-f581-5ed1-b4ad-918c440107af" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438785} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "83f38ae9-f0f2-572d-9185-5d097fca9a0a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437514} {:answer/id #uuid "2db0b74d-25fc-5ea3-b717-639ac2457432" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437515}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2db0b74d-25fc-5ea3-b717-639ac2457432" :answer/type {:d