q-131361" :question/problem "![](images/17/1709a94b7361a1e8764d94199f9e84802ae925a09e6481250d0846b83bb6549f.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y,z),$ shown above. Given that $F(x,y,z)$ is independent of $z,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$\n- **II.** $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0$\n- **III.** $\\text{curl}\\,F$ points in the negative $z$-direction.\n- **IV.** $F$ is irrotational" :question/worked-solution "Recall that $\\text{curl}\\,F$ denotes the curl of the vector field $F.$\n\nTo understand intuitively whether a vector field has curl at a point $P$, imagine that our vector field $F$ represents the velocity field of a stream of flowing water. We place a paddlewheel at $P$ with the axis of rotation pointing in the $z$-direction, and we note whether the paddlewheel rotates or not.\n\n- If the paddlewheel is forced to rotate due to the action of the water, then the vector field has curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n- If the paddlewheel does not rotate due to the action of the water, then the velocity field has zero curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n![](images/7c/7c831425eae7afd709d546a8e05100f495adc04bba6450cfa56d370b415a28f5.png)\n\nIf $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$ everywhere in ${R}^{3}$, we say that $F$ is irrotational.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement:\n\n- Statement II is true, whereas statement I is false. If a paddlewheel were placed at any point $P$ in the manner described above, it would rotate clockwise. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Using our right hand, if we wrap our fingers in the direction of rotation (clockwise), our thumb will point into the screen. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F$ also points into from the screen, in the direction of decreasing $z.$\n\n- Statement IV is false. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0,$ the vector field $F$ is not irrotational.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266080 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "759144aa-479f-5d85-898a-3020b5e809ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437864} {:answer/id #uuid "d58a9696-938d-5e6c-99bf-4b58b6d7d42a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437865}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d58a9696-938d-5e6c-99bf-4b58b6d7d42a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437865} :answer-field/id #uuid "0241eaa0-bc57-5fa6-a00a-6329bb64d727" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438961} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "708e20e7-d995-5c69-a88e-e75297d83f41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437866} {:answer/id #uuid "ecf7c82f-2cd4-5a1e-86ce-817f325c1c88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437867}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "708e20e7-d995-5c69-a88e-e75297d83f41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437866} :answer-field/id #uuid "58062d8a-4502-5ada-ad29-4c19534062ae" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438962} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "28338c89-d67a-5e71-b91f-8d1aa4c5632c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437868} {:answer/id #uuid "35b99a55-bd57-5584-83e7-24b20dcf426d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "35b99a55-bd57-5584-83e7-24b20dcf426d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437869} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a2d3df4-555b-5933-9b1d-284221d034cd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438963} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46189e0a-937f-5303-a19e-e8e9671daedc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437870} {:answer/id #uuid "a33bbeb3-b68d-5ea0-b9c4-a6bc64ed2f6e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46189e0a-937f-5303-a19e-e8e9671daedc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437870} :answer-field/id #uuid "36112e37-bcb8-5a8d-a232-63977d54a9c7" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438964}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f317d036-e0ac-5288-a673-4543ead19ce4" :question/math-academy-id "q-131366" :question/problem "![](images/78/781a4e33b8b55762b2dcb7575d08315b5842f83d6d78a5136a1c353eefd3069d.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y,z),$ shown above. Given that $F(x,y,z)$ is independent of $z,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$\n- **II.** $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0$\n- **III.** $F$ is irrotational\n- **IV.** $\\text{curl}\\,F$ points in the negative $z$-direction." :question/worked-solution "Recall that $\\text{curl}\\,F$ denotes the curl of the vector field $F.$\n\nTo understand intuitively whether a vector field has curl at a point $P$, imagine that our vector field $F$ represents the velocity field of a stream of flowing water. We place a paddlewheel at $P$ with the axis of rotation pointing in the $z$-direction, and we note whether the paddlewheel rotates or not.\n\n- If the paddlewheel does not rotate due to the action of the water, then the velocity field has zero curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n- If the paddlewheel is forced to rotate due to the action of the water, then the vector field has curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n![](images/97/979b63f21e56924bd7880f9487cf829089e38cf14d287e70196c7a661e41f97f.png)\n\nMoreover, if $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$ everywhere in ${R}^{3}$, we say that $F$ is irrotational.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement:\n\n- Statement I is true, whereas statement II is false. If a paddlewheel were placed at any point $P$ in the manner described above, it would not rotate. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ the vector field $F$ is irrotational.\n\n- Statement IV is false. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ it points in neither the positive nor the negative $z$-direction.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186382833 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d228b638-d4d7-5016-bf8d-0f56d5c4fadc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437454} {:answer/id #uuid "95914e2c-927b-55a2-922e-4d9800a2f38d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437455}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d228b638-d4d7-5016-bf8d-0f56d5c4fadc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437454} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b934add-e755-50b4-b067-100e72fc3b58" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438756} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bd1d98c-7ae9-55ca-9482-d88b90b0af24" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437456} {:answer/id #uuid "e43b1943-3654-567b-9fed-68e4254f3b7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437457}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e43b1943-3654-567b-9fed-68e4254f3b7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437457} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6ddf4cd-c05f-5097-8310-bbb48f377de3" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438757} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e686502-6511-5a87-9141-3f040b14bb72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437458} {:answer/id #uuid "d0bb29aa-53cb-587d-8e87-04375c2d7a7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437459}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d0bb29aa-53cb-587d-8e87-04375c2d7a7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437459} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8779a01-b29f-51f0-ab0b-183634a90544" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438758} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f0077624-dbc3-55a6-9c6d-142323470d70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437460} {:answer/id #uuid "3165d50d-3b7d-5943-9785-4266dd0bd54a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437461}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f0077624-dbc3-55a6-9c6d-142323470d70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437460} :answer-field/id #uuid "1bdf6bee-a19c-5f09-acb1-0c8cf50d5033" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438759}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b44da0aa-9add-572b-86e2-310e134b6864" :question/math-academy-id "q-105664" :question/problem "![](images/56/5643e87bfb5dfb5c29750f48abffe2443bf656901d74a47a0aa39bddfd0c1590.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y,z),$ shown above. Given that $F(x,y,z)$ is independent of $z,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$\n- **II.** $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0$\n- **III.** $\\text{curl}\\,F$ points in the positive $z$-direction.\n- **IV.** $F$ is irrotational" :question/worked-solution "Recall that $\\text{curl}\\,F$ denotes the curl of the vector field $F.$\n\nTo understand intuitively whether a vector field has a curl at a point $P$, imagine that our vector field $F$ represents the velocity field of a stream of flowing water. We place a paddlewheel at $P$ with the axis of rotation pointing in the $z$-direction, and we note whether the paddlewheel rotates or not.\n\n- If the paddlewheel is forced to rotate due to the action of the water, then the vector field has curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n- If the paddlewheel does not rotate due to the action of the water, then the velocity field has zero curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n![](images/86/86aee33cdfa96ac0a61468cc9657e791e399f31c024cdbc3a932193dc897d534.png)\n\nIf $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$ everywhere in ${R}^{3}$, we say that $F$ is irrotational.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement:\n\n- Statement II is true, whereas statement I is false. If a paddlewheel were placed at any point $P$ in the manner described above, it would rotate clockwise. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Using our right hand, if we wrap our fingers in the direction of rotation (counterclockwise), our thumb will point away from the screen. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F$ also points away from the screen, in the direction of increasing $z.$\n\n- Statement IV is false. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0,$ the vector field $F$ is not irrotational.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186382840 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dbe322f2-3c81-5a3f-8384-a79b47c4192c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437494} {:answer/id #uuid "cd9d57fd-6acd-56c1-9f2e-b83a1aa501a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437495}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd9d57fd-6acd-56c1-9f2e-b83a1aa501a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437495} :answer-field/id #uuid "3898a42c-a0be-50b6-8124-860e6bfc10bd" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438776} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ebb3d1f-b473-5ff0-99dc-159e666e7930" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437496} {:answer/id #uuid "f0f04e94-0931-5901-b36f-4cf0aefffcb9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437497}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ebb3d1f-b473-5ff0-99dc-159e666e7930" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437496} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f5874c9-61e8-5f41-9f79-2b146b618ffd" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438777} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d37dd19-280c-5e67-ae16-cb2d1a8d8768" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437498} {:answer/id #uuid "82315627-af21-5603-83df-7fa71a175af5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437499}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0d37dd19-280c-5e67-ae16-cb2d1a8d8768" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437498} :answer-field/id #uuid "87749995-78bc-517b-80a4-3ef44008acb3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438778} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e6a54cb-d3b8-527e-8166-9d17d4c66cfb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437500} {:answer/id #uuid "f7668637-64a8-52ae-aa22-7ac35611bf2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437501}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e6a54cb-d3b8-527e-8166-9d17d4c66cfb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437500} :answer-field/id #uuid "b01a01c4-08c1-5b79-8565-85e0e916e53a" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438779}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "73b73866-28ec-57e7-b02e-d1bd053c3918" :question/math-academy-id "q-105693" :question/problem "![](images/10/10a9960200e87e1b7b8a38789d5f70f29e48ad1f0a6e2913713da90c532eca6e.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y,z),$ shown above. Given that $F(x,y,z)$ is independent of $z,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$\n- **II.** $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0$\n- **III.** $F$ is not irrotational\n- **IV.** $\\text{curl}\\,F$ points in the negative $z$-direction." :question/worked-solution "Recall that $\\text{curl}\\,F$ denotes the curl of the vector field $F.$\n\nTo understand intuitively whether a vector field has curl at a point $P$, imagine that our vector field $F$ represents the velocity field of a stream of flowing water. We place a paddlewheel at $P$ with the axis of rotation pointing in the $z$-direction, and we note whether the paddlewheel rotates or not.\n\n- If the paddlewheel does not rotate due to the action of the water, then the velocity field has zero curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n- If the paddlewheel is forced to rotate due to the action of the water, then the vector field has curl, i.e., $\\text{curl}\\,F\\ne 0.$\n\n![](images/59/594106633e422d24b9fea113d24fb6367fdef5ac52724931860e4163e33ce992.png)\n\nMoreover, if $\\text{curl}\\,F=0$ everywhere in ${R}^{3}$, we say that $F$ is irrotational.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement:\n\n- Statement I is true, whereas statement II is false. If a paddlewheel were placed at any point $P$ in the manner described above, it would not rotate. Therefore, $\\text{curl}\\,F=0.$\n\n- Statements III and IV are false. Since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ the vector field $F$ is irrotational. And, since $\\text{curl}\\,F=0,$ it points in neither the positive nor the negative $z$-direction.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186409610 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8286c6dd-7fea-5018-b722-69a0848b0bcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437502} {:answer/id #uuid "5d52abdf-7ac5-55e3-92ae-9aec71a85bbf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437503}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8286c6dd-7fea-5018-b722-69a0848b0bcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437502} :answer-field/id #uuid "cb53bf33-5552-5395-8fd4-4d42b50a2a01" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438780} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a4939bd9-e529-5af3-b533-59e09598d0e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437504} {:answer/id #uuid "2b9d89e5-98a9-5520-8de9-5ddb178c0664" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437505}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b9d89e5-98a9-5520-8de9-5ddb178c0664" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437505} :answer-field/id #uuid "2a596bab-34c8-5ee7-9e82-c47a2988e863" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438781} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "273314f4-9ed1-52ac-8d9b-6701a93d8748" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :